  <div class="VerticalSpacing VerticalSpacing--m">
      <div class="Header">
          
          
    <div class="Header-heading">
        
            <h2 class="Heading Heading--l">
                LCH&#39;s Listed Rates clearing service</h2>
        
    </div>

          
          
      </div>
              
  </div>








    
        
    
    
    

    
    
    
    
        <div class="Grid Grid--2313">
            <div class="Grid-items">
                <div class="Grid-item">
                    
    
    
    
    
        
    
    
    
        


    
    




   
	
	   
    
<script src="/etc.clientlibs/forge/components/content/rte/v2/rte/clientlibs/publish.min.js"></script>



	   
		   
			
			 
			  <div class="RichText   ">
			   <p>LCH’s Listed Rates clearing service, in partnership with FMX Futures Exchange, enables members and clients to generate margin and operational efficiencies between their OTC and listed derivatives positions.&nbsp;</p>
<p>This is achieved by clearing&nbsp;US SOFR and Treasury futures through our Listed Rates service and portfolio margining against cleared interest rate swap (IRS) positions at SwapClear, using our fully automated Portfolio Margining service.&nbsp;</p>
<p>The result is a potentially lower margin requirement, reduced counterparty risk – and a safer, more efficient portfolio.</p>

			  </div>
	   
   
   



    
    

    
    

                </div>
                <div class="Grid-item">
                    
    
    
    
    
        
    
    
    
    

    
    

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        

        

        

        

        

        
    
    


    
    

    
    

        </div>
    </div>

        
    


    
        
    
    
    

    

    

    
        
    
