  <div class="VerticalSpacing VerticalSpacing--m">
      <div class="Header">
          
          
    <div class="Header-heading">
        
            <h3 class="Heading Heading--m">
                A stronger, more competitive USD derivatives market</h3>
        
    </div>

          
          
      </div>
              
  </div>








    
        


    
    




   
	
	   
    



	   <div class="VerticalSpacing VerticalSpacing--l">
		   
			
			 
			  <div class="RichText   ">
			   <p>Greater diversity and choice in the US&nbsp;dollar derivatives market increases resilience, capacity and provides additional liquidity.</p>

			  </div>
	   </div>
   
   



    
        




    
    




    
  
  

  


  <div class="VerticalSpacing VerticalSpacing--m">
      <div class="Header">
          
          
    <div class="Header-heading">
        
            <h3 class="Heading Heading--m">
                Trusted and seamlessly integrated</h3>
        
    </div>

          
          
      </div>
              
  </div>








    
        


    
    




   
	
	   
    



	   <div class="VerticalSpacing VerticalSpacing--l">
		   
			
			 
			  <div class="RichText   ">
			   <p>Trusted, market-leading LCH clearing infrastructure, in partnership with&nbsp;FMX Futures Exchange.&nbsp;The LSEG ecosystem and BGC Group’s world-class marketplace&nbsp;combine state-of-the-art technology to provide a new industry standard and seamless integration with independent software vendors (ISVs).</p>

			  </div>
	   </div>
   
   



    
        




    
    




    
  
  

  


  <div class="VerticalSpacing VerticalSpacing--m">
      <div class="Header">
          
          
    <div class="Header-heading">
        
            <h3 class="Heading Heading--m">
                Safer and more efficient trading</h3>
        
    </div>

          
          
      </div>
              
  </div>








    
        


    
    




   
	
	   
    



	   <div class="VerticalSpacing VerticalSpacing--l">
		   
			
			 
			  <div class="RichText   ">
			   <p>Potential for margin benefits by connecting your listed rates portfolio with the world’s deepest OTC interest rate liquidity pool, driving a safer and more efficient interest rate swap portfolio.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Our Portfolio Margining service runs daily and provides a fully automated, low-touch method of offsetting risks across cleared OTC and listed rates portfolios. Our process determines what to optimise, quickly identifies all available margin offsets and discovers correlations that collectively offer risk reduction across your aggregate portfolio.</p>

			  </div>
	   </div>
   
   



    
        




    
    




    
  
  

  


  <div class="VerticalSpacing VerticalSpacing--m">
      <div class="Header">
          
          
    <div class="Header-heading">
        
            <h3 class="Heading Heading--m">
                Risk management excellence</h3>
        
    </div>

          
          
      </div>
              
  </div>








    
        


    
    




   
	
	   
    



	   
		   
			
			 
			  <div class="RichText   ">
			   <p>Robust, proven risk management of the highest standard.</p>

			  </div>
	   
   
   



    
    

    
    

                </div>
